<article class="post featured">
  <header class="major">
    <h2>A Small Country Church <br>with a Big Heart</h2>
    <p>Nestled in the piney woods of Deep East Texas, Pollok Baptist Church is located approximately fifteen miles north of the City of Lufkin.</p>
  </header>
  <p>Surrounded by farm homes, pastures, and beautiful country scenery, the church building is located on Highway 7 West, approximately &frac14; mile west of Highway 69N.</p>
  <p>The church, however, is scattered throughout the local surrounding communities. Even though considered a small country church, PBC has a big heart and a great love toward worshiping the Lord God Almighty, enjoys fellowshipping with one another and other local churches, and welcomes visitors with open arms.</p>
